; ============================================================
; TITLE:    Snail Shell
; CATEGORY: Spirals & Curves
; LEVEL:    Beginner
; TAGS:     spiral, curve, growing step, picture
; SUMMARY:  Draws a snail whose shell is a smooth spiral made by turning the same amount while the steps keep growing.
; ============================================================
;
; WHAT IT DOES
;   If the turtle always turns 10 degrees but takes a slightly
;   longer step each time, it curls outwards in a smooth spiral,
;   just like a snail's shell. The program draws the shell with a
;   thick pen, then gives the snail a body, two eye stalks, and a
;   shiny trail.
;
; HOW TO USE
;   Press Run. Change the 3 in the SPIRALSHELL line to wind the shell more
;   or less, or the 0.04 in SPIRALSHELL to make it open faster.
;
; CONCEPTS YOU WILL LEARN
;   * same turn + growing step = spiral
;   * the step grows by multiplying, so the shell keeps its shape
;     as it gets bigger (like real shells)
;   * combining a curve with simple shapes to make a picture
;
; THINGS TO TRY
;   * Make the shell wind the other way with LEFT.
;   * Add 0.5 to the step each time instead of multiplying. Is it
;     still shell-shaped?
;   * Draw a family of snails of different sizes.
; ============================================================

; Spiral out from the middle. The step starts tiny and gets 3.2 percent
; longer every time, while the turn stays 10 degrees.
to spiralshell :turns
  localmake "step 0.7
  repeat int :turns * 36 [
    forward :step
    left 10
    make "step :step * 1.032
  ]
end

; The body: a long flat shape with a round head at the right and a
; pointed tail at the left. The head is half a circle walked in steps.
to body
  penup setxy -230 -150 setheading 90 pendown
  setpencolor [120 80 50] setpensize 4
  filled [200 160 115] [
    forward 400
    repeat 18 [forward 5.6 left 10]
    forward 290
    setxy -230 -150
  ]
end

to stalks
  setpencolor [120 80 50] setpensize 5
  foreach [[205 -30] [240 -40]] [
    penup setxy 185 -95 pendown setpos ?
    setpensize 14 dot ? setpensize 5
  ]
end

clearscreen hideturtle
setbackground [215 240 200]
; the body first, then the shell on top of it
body
; the shell: two spirals, a fat light one and a thin dark one on top,
; so it looks like a striped shell
penup setxy 10 25 setheading 110 pendown
setpencolor [235 190 120] setpensize 18
spiralshell 3
penup setxy 10 25 setheading 110 pendown
setpencolor [150 70 40] setpensize 5
spiralshell 3
stalks
; a silvery trail behind the snail
penup setxy -390 -150 setheading 90 setpencolor [200 210 230] setpensize 6
pendown forward 160
